And you look at your father.

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:31.260
And he has that same look in his eyes. He's kind of
waiting. But he's also afraid.

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:37.400
So he looks at you like,
"Can you help me?"

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:42.500
In life, things get tough, life is tough right now.

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:47.360
And then you say, "Dad, don't worry.  I'll take care of this!

00:22:47.820 --> 00:22:49.820
I am studying lam rim.

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:54.120
I study a lot about emptiness.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:23:01.280
And I practically know that I will have the tools
to help you soon.

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:04.680
So don't worry.  I'll take care of this.  I'll take
care of this.  And

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:09.540
please: You do
n't have to be afraid.  You don't have to worry.

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:13.100
I know what to do and I do it.

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:17.120
Everything will be fine, so don't worry!"

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:29.280
And then it could be someone close to you, your
wife, your husband, or your children,
one of your children,

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:32.100
their image comes to mind.

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.140
Just their face.

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:44.940
And they look at you too, like, "Can you help me?  Things are bad, things are very bad!"

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:50.940
Things are terrible, there is no other hope.
"Can you help me?"

00:23:54.220 --> 00:24:02.140
And you say:
"I can handle it, I'll take care of it.  I
can!  I

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:07.920
will have enough strength to take care of you.  You

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:10.026
really don't need to worry.  I know what's

00:24:10.026 --> 00:24:11.623
happening.  I

00:24:11.623 --> 00:24:13.220
know your situation.  I know what this

00:24:13.880 --> 00:24:17.015
life is like.  I figured it out

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:24.500
.
and I will take full care of you.  You do

00:24:24.680 --> 00:24:28.640
n't have to worry.  You
really don't need to worry.

00:24:28.660 --> 00:24:31.320
I'll take care of you."

00:24:37.420 --> 00:24:43.320
And then that face disappears, and you can start visualizing, one by one, the faces of people you know.

00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:48.000
Close family members.

00:24:49.260 --> 00:24:51.260
Uncles, aunts.

00:24:51.680 --> 00:24:53.680
Brothers, sisters.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:24:57.280
Nephews, nieces.

00:24:59.300 --> 00:25:07.420
One by one, you visualize them
and comfort them.

00:25:08.480 --> 00:25:12.920
And you say to them, "I really will take care of you.  You
have nothing to worry about."

00:25:19.120 --> 00:25:22.000
And so, you go through all the people that you know.

00:25:22.780 --> 00:25:25.480
All the people that you've ever met in your life.

00:25:26.480 --> 00:25:33.840
Then you start with all the people that you haven't met and all the people in this world.

00:25:34.500 --> 00:25:36.500
Start with your own neighborhood.

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:45.820
Go to the city, the entire city, and you know, it's not like you can cover the whole world.

00:25:46.440 --> 00:25:49.400
But take one person from here and one person from there. Go to the

00:25:50.940 --> 00:25:56.580
edge of this continent that you live on.

00:25:57.640 --> 00:25:59.640
Go through everyone, every single one.

00:26:00.900 --> 00:26:02.900
And then go on.
To other continents.

00:26:07.920 --> 00:26:13.480
And in this way we'll go through all the people in this world.

00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:18.400
Just sitting here.

00:26:19.160 --> 00:26:23.820
And then you can start with the
animals in this world, the fish, for example. I'm

00:26:24.920 --> 00:26:34.380
not talking about species of animals.
I'm talking about helping each individual animal.

00:26:36.500 --> 00:26:39.890
Every animal is looking at you. Every animal is waiting.

00:26:39.890 --> 00:26:44.260
Every animal is afraid.
Every animal gets your personal guarantee.

00:26:44.620 --> 00:26:46.620
And you say, "I'll take care of this!  I will take care of you."

00:26:48.770 --> 00:26:53.679
Imagine that you are going through every creature, all the little creatures at the bottom of the sea. The

00:26:56.150 --> 00:26:58.150
