00:26:59.780 --> 00:27:01.780
Get to know each one of them.

00:27:03.100 --> 00:27:05.260
Talk to them.

00:27:05.720 --> 00:27:13.720
And when you are done with all the creatures in this world,
we will start with the ones in the next world.

00:27:13.720 --> 00:27:16.980
But I don't know where the next world is.
Is it Alpha Centauri?

00:27:17.660 --> 00:27:21.640
Maybe it's a few light years away.

00:27:24.040 --> 00:27:30.960
Go there with your mind and start doing the same meditation
for all the people in that world.

00:27:34.060 --> 00:27:41.660
And in this way we go through every world
in the entire universe.

00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:51.740
And the karma of meeting
each one of the seven billion human beings

00:27:52.840 --> 00:27:57.600
and trillions of other creatures on a planet.

00:27:58.060 --> 00:28:04.640
And then visiting all the planets that exist. The countless planets.

00:28:04.640 --> 00:28:06.640
Meeting every being there.

00:28:09.680 --> 00:28:11.680
That is bodhichitta.

00:28:12.020 --> 00:28:15.820
That is having the direct experience of bodhichitta.

00:28:15.840 --> 00:28:24.340
For this episode, please
try to get this feeling. You

00:28:26.140 --> 00:28:31.260
don't have to worry, you do
n't have to worry about your family.  You do

00:28:31.880 --> 00:28:35.080
n't have to worry about your country.

00:28:35.780 --> 00:28:40.740
And you don't have to worry about a world that's overwhelmed by a virus. These are small things!

00:28:41.720 --> 00:28:47.680
By the way, we'll take care of them.
We're working on a much bigger project here. We're

00:28:49.460 --> 00:28:54.820
committed to helping an entire universe.

00:28:55.920 --> 00:28:58.380
Countless billions of beings.

00:28:59.400 --> 00:29:03.560
Countless billions of animals and other creatures.

00:29:05.140 --> 00:29:10.680
And we do have this ability. You do have this power. I pray that you have this power in this lifetime.

00:29:11.240 --> 00:29:14.760
I pray that you unleash it in this lifetime.

00:29:14.760 --> 00:29:28.840
Your mind already has the ability to reach out to every living being and promise to take care of them.

00:29:32.500 --> 00:29:36.700
So the purpose of this lam rim,
the purpose of this retreat [of this course] would be,

00:29:37.420 --> 00:29:40.160
to be like traveling in the middle of the sun.

00:29:40.600 --> 00:29:43.000
Think of every living being. The

00:29:43.360 --> 00:29:46.860
countless beings in a boundless universe.

00:29:48.320 --> 00:29:49.960
Get to know them, one by one.

00:29:49.960 --> 00:29:51.420
Make a promise to each one of them.

00:29:52.220 --> 00:29:58.360
That's what happens
during the first  direct experiences of bodhichitta. It

00:29:58.360 --> 00:29:59.980
really happens. It

00:30:00.060 --> 00:30:01.843
feels like this.

00:30:01.843 --> 00:30:05.340
If you keep imagining
this, it will make this happen.

00:30:06.000 --> 00:30:07.020
Really!

00:30:07.020 --> 00:30:10.759
So it's up to you whether you want it to happen.

00:30:11.340 --> 00:30:14.660
If you really want to be a real bodhisattva,

00:30:15.680 --> 00:30:22.220
then practice.
Practice this visualization once or twice a day.

00:30:22.980 --> 00:30:28.140
Just when you have a few minutes. Just imagine.
In your imagination, right?

00:30:29.159 --> 00:30:32.989
And that will help you trigger this state.
And you will reach bodhichitta. That's why

00:30:35.060 --> 00:30:43.120
something like the virus, for that kind of bodhisattva, the virus is not a very important thing.

00:30:43.120 --> 00:30:45.816
It's a small thing.
It's a small thing.

00:30:45.820 --> 00:30:47.240
Making money. Making a living.

00:30:47.820 --> 00:30:49.360


00:30:49.600 --> 00:30:50.940
Feeding your family.

00:30:51.600 --> 00:30:53.600
Finding an apartment.

00:30:54.060 --> 00:30:58.660
These are incredibly small things. They
're nothing.

